@host = http://localhost:3000

### ============ AUTENTICACIÓ ============

### Registre d'un usuari nou
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "laura",
  "email": "laura@exemple.cat",
  "password": "laura1234"
}

### Registre amb dades invàlides (400)
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "a",
  "email": "no-es-un-correu",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login com a ADMIN (guarda la cookie)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

### Login amb credencials incorrectes (401)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Pàgina protegida (cal haver fet login)
GET {{host}}/protected

### Perfil
GET {{host}}/profile

### Logout
POST {{host}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json


### ============ USUARIS ============

### Llista d'usuaris (admin)
GET {{host}}/users

### Detall d'un usuari
GET {{host}}/users/2

### Crear usuari (admin)
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "pere",
  "email": "pere@exemple.cat",
  "password": "pere1234",
  "role": "user"
}

### Modificar usuari
PUT {{host}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.nova@exemple.cat"
}

### Eliminar usuari (admin)
DELETE {{host}}/users/5


### ============ RECURSOS ============

### Llista de recursos
GET {{host}}/resources

### Detall d'un recurs
GET {{host}}/resources/1

### Crear recurs (admin)
POST {{host}}/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aula 202",
  "description": "Aula amb pissarra digital",
  "capacity": 25
}

### Modificar recurs (admin)
PUT {{host}}/resources/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 40
}

### Eliminar recurs (admin; 409 si té reserves)
DELETE {{host}}/resources/4


### ============ RESERVES ============

### Llista de reserves
GET {{host}}/bookings

### Detall d'una reserva
GET {{host}}/bookings/1

### Crear reserva
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "start": "2027-01-12T11:00:00.000Z",
  "end": "2027-01-12T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### Crear reserva que se SOLAPA amb la #1 (409)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "start": "2027-01-12T10:00:00.000Z",
  "end": "2027-01-12T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### Reserva amb dates invertides (400)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "start": "2027-02-12T12:00:00.000Z",
  "end": "2027-02-12T11:00:00.000Z"
}

### Modificar reserva
PUT {{host}}/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "end": "2027-01-12T11:30:00.000Z"
}

### Cancel·lar reserva
DELETE {{host}}/bookings/1


### ============ NOTIFICACIONS ============

### Llista de notificacions
GET {{host}}/notifications

### Detall d'una notificació
GET {{host}}/notifications/1

### Enviar notificació (admin)
POST {{host}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "message": "Recorda confirmar la teva reserva"
}

### Marcar com a llegida
PUT {{host}}/notifications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "read": true
}

### Eliminar notificació
DELETE {{host}}/notifications/1


### ============ PROVA DE PERMISOS ============
### Fes primer login com a MARIA i prova:

### Login com a MARIA (usuari normal)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "maria",
  "password": "maria1234"
}

### Maria intenta llistar usuaris (403)
GET {{host}}/users

### Maria intenta crear un recurs (403)
POST {{host}}/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Prova",
  "capacity": 5
}

### Sense login, qualsevol ruta CRUD dóna 401 (fes logout abans)
GET {{host}}/bookings
